			"widgets_values":[
				"[1] On the rooftop of a colorful futuristic city, Doraemon and Pikachu sit side by side on a soft grassy mat, basking in the warm glow of the evening sky. Doraemon holds a dorayaki in one hand and a quirky gadget in the other, while Pikachu excitedly waves its tiny paws, with sparks of electricity flickering on its cheeks. Behind them, neon towers stretch endlessly, and floating trains zoom along sky-high rails. In the distance, a shooting star streaks across the sky, lighting up their curious and joyful faces. The whole scene brims with childlike wonder and a sense of sci-fi adventure.\n\n[2] In a sun-dappled, mysterious forest, Doraemon and Pikachu are walking along a leaf-covered trail, embarking on an adventurous journey. Doraemon carries a stuffed backpack, occasionally pulling out a quirky gadget to find their way, while Pikachu bounces alongside him, sniffing the ground and occasionally watching butterflies flutter by. Tall trees tower above them, with sunlight filtering through the branches, casting shifting patterns of light. A gentle stream flows nearby, and the air is filled with the fresh scent of earth and grass. The two friends laugh and chat as if searching for a long-lost hidden treasure.\n\n[3] On a rainy evening, Doraemon and Pikachu take shelter in a cozy corner convenience store. Doraemon holds a clear umbrella, raindrops still clinging to his blue fur, while Pikachu shakes off its damp ears and stares wide-eyed at the snack shelves. The scent of freshly made rice balls fills the air, and the soft lighting reflects gently off the rain-speckled windows. The two friends choose hot cocoa and donuts, then sit by the window on tall stools, chatting happily as they watch the raindrops trickle down the glass. The entire scene feels warm and quiet—like a tiny refuge in the heart of the city."
